Nope.  In fact, to my knowledge there is no way to affect the
enchantment on such 'plussed' rings in any way.  Of course, they can
be blessed or cursed in the usual manner, but the amount they affect
your charisma, AC or damage remains the same.  The plus even remains
when the ring is polymorphed, so if a blessed +3 ring of adornment is
polymorphed into a ring of protection, it will be a blessed +3 ring of
protection.

